{"id":"9de215729247efbe","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-order9-completely-prime-filter.md","title":"ZFC Order9 Completely Prime Filter","display":"df-zfc-order9-completely-prime-filter — ZFC Order9 Completely Prime Filter","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order9-completely-prime-filter","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order9-completely-prime-filter"],"display":"df-zfc-order9-completely-prime-filter — ZFC Order9 Completely Prime Filter","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-filter.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-order6-complete-lattice.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order9-completely-prime-filter"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order9-completely-prime-filter</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order9-completely-prime-filter — ZFC Order9 Completely Prime Filter"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1331244a5201bb99\" href=\"?note=1331244a5201bb99\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-filter.md\">../batch15/58-df-filter.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"87092f843dd2184b\" href=\"?note=87092f843dd2184b\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-order6-complete-lattice.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-order6-complete-lattice.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq L\\times L\">\\(R\\subseteq L\\times L\\)</span> (complete-lattice order, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"87092f843dd2184b\" href=\"?note=87092f843dd2184b\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-order6-complete-lattice.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-order6-complete-lattice.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\subseteq L\">\\(F\\subseteq L\\)</span> (order filter, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1331244a5201bb99\" href=\"?note=1331244a5201bb99\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-filter.md\">../batch15/58-df-filter.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq L\">\\(A\\subseteq L\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in L\">\\(u\\in L\\)</span> (a family and its possible least upper bound)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder6CompleteLattice}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder6CompleteLattice}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Filter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Filter}_S\\)</span> (complete-lattice and order-filter predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9CompletelyPrimeFilter}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9CompletelyPrimeFilter}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order9\\text{-}completely\\text{-}prime\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder9CompletelyPrimeFilter}_S(F,L,R)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcOrder6CompleteLattice}_S(L,R)\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(F,L,R)\\land\\forall A\\subseteq L\\;\\forall u\\in L\\;\\Bigl(\\bigl((\\forall a\\in A\\;\\langle a,u\\rangle\\in R)\\land\\forall v\\in L\\;((\\forall a\\in A\\;\\langle a,v\\rangle\\in R)\\to\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in R)\\bigr)\\land u\\in F\\to A\\cap F\\neq\\emptyset\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order9\\text{-}completely\\text{-}prime\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder9CompletelyPrimeFilter}_S(F,L,R)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcOrder6CompleteLattice}_S(L,R)\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(F,L,R)\\land\\forall A\\subseteq L\\;\\forall u\\in L\\;\\Bigl(\\bigl((\\forall a\\in A\\;\\langle a,u\\rangle\\in R)\\land\\forall v\\in L\\;((\\forall a\\in A\\;\\langle a,v\\rangle\\in R)\\to\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in R)\\bigr)\\land u\\in F\\to A\\cap F\\neq\\emptyset\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The antecedent spells out that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> is the least upper bound of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>; hence the definition does not rely on an undeclared infinitary-join operation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-filter.md","status":"resolved","id":"1331244a5201bb99","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-filter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-order6-complete-lattice.md","status":"resolved","id":"87092f843dd2184b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-order6-complete-lattice.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-order6-complete-lattice.md","status":"resolved","id":"87092f843dd2184b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$R\\subseteq L\\times L$ (complete-lattice order, see [[../batch10/58-df-zfc-order6-complete-lattice.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-filter.md","status":"resolved","id":"1331244a5201bb99","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$F\\subseteq L$ (order filter, see [[../batch15/58-df-filter.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"R\\subseteq L\\times L","display":false},{"tex":"F\\subseteq L","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq L","display":false},{"tex":"u\\in L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder6CompleteLattice}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Filter}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9CompletelyPrimeFilter}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order9\\text{-}completely\\text{-}prime\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder9CompletelyPrimeFilter}_S(F,L,R)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcOrder6CompleteLattice}_S(L,R)\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(F,L,R)\\land\\forall A\\subseteq L\\;\\forall u\\in L\\;\\Bigl(\\bigl((\\forall a\\in A\\;\\langle a,u\\rangle\\in R)\\land\\forall v\\in L\\;((\\forall a\\in A\\;\\langle a,v\\rangle\\in R)\\to\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in R)\\bigr)\\land u\\in F\\to A\\cap F\\neq\\emptyset\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":1573,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2969","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-order9-completely-prime-filter.md|58-df-zfc-order9-completely-prime-filter]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","1331244a5201bb99","87092f843dd2184b"]}